@startuml
title Secuencia — Polling, evaluación y alerta

actor Scheduler
participant "PollingService" as Poll
participant "RemoteEndpoint" as Remote
participant "DB" as DB
participant "RuleEngine" as Rules
participant "AlertService" as Alert
participant "Frontend" as Front

Scheduler -> Poll : ejecutar ciclo
Poll -> DB : obtener endpoints activos
DB --> Poll : endpoints
loop por endpoint
  Poll -> Remote : GET / fuente remota
  Remote --> Poll : payload JSON/HTML/API
  Poll -> DB : guardar lecturas / estados
end
Poll -> Rules : evaluar reglas con últimos estados
Rules -> DB : leer umbrales / reglas
DB --> Rules : reglas
Rules --> Alert : generar alertas nuevas
Alert -> DB : persistir AlertEvent
Alert --> Front : evento disponible por API / polling
@enduml
